THIRD-PARTY FONTS
=================

This repository redistributes font binaries. They are not covered by the MIT
license above, and they are here rather than on a CDN on purpose: the demo has
to render correctly on a machine with no route to the internet.

All three families are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1,
whose full text is reproduced at licenses/OFL-1.1.txt. The OFL permits this
redistribution and requires that the license text travel with the binaries,
which is what this file and that one are for.

The subset files below are derived from the upstream releases — reduced to the
glyphs this demo actually renders, which is what makes them small enough to
ship. Subsetting is a Modified Version under the OFL, so each entry names the
upstream copyright holder and the family's Reserved Font Name.


