OTHER DEPENDENCIES
==================

Everything else this demo depends on is fetched at build time by Maven, npm or
pip and is not redistributed here. Each carries its own license; see the
respective pom.xml, package.json and requirements.txt.

Container base images are pinned by digest in docker-compose.yml and in each
module's Dockerfile, and are likewise fetched rather than redistributed.
